225d87fb0d7db5af2a14407839ae64685c08309","modified":1780381865982},{"_id":"public/img/ghost-img.png","hash":"1dd9e6e6191b50029fc2bb64eb4fc7365c4c4816","modified":1780381865982}],"Category":[{"name":"随笔","_id":"cmpw9e80r0002p2rq0lraa8sz"}],"Data":[],"Page":[{"title":"关于","date":"2026-06-02T06:30:47.000Z","_content":"\n## 关于本站\n\n这是一个使用 **Hexo** 静态博客框架和 **ZenMind** 主题搭建的个人博客。\n\n在这里，我会分享技术思考、学习笔记、项目经验以及生活感悟。\n\n## 联系方式\n\n- GitHub: [你的 GitHub](https://github.com/your-username)\n- Email: your-email@example.com\n\n## 关于 ZenMind 主题\n\nZenMind 是一款简洁单栏 Hexo 主题，其名来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。由 [@lenchou95](https://twitter.com/lenchou95) 修改自 [one-paper](https://github.com/zheli-design/hexo-theme-one-paper) 主题。\n","source":"about/index.md","raw":"---\ntitle: 关于\ndate: 2026-06-02 14:30:47\n---\n\n## 关于本站\n\n这是一个使用 **Hexo** 静态博客框架和 **ZenMind** 主题搭建的个人博客。\n\n在这里，我会分享技术思考、学习笔记、项目经验以及生活感悟。\n\n## 联系方式\n\n- GitHub: [你的 GitHub](https://github.com/your-username)\n- Email: your-email@example.com\n\n## 关于 ZenMind 主题\n\nZenMind 是一款简洁单栏 Hexo 主题，其名来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。由 [@lenchou95](https://twitter.com/lenchou95) 修改自 [one-paper](https://github.com/zheli-design/hexo-theme-one-paper) 主题。\n","updated":"2026-06-02T06:30:58.795Z","path":"about/index.html","comments":1,"layout":"page","_id":"cmpw9e7xb0000p2rq2owoawm6","content":"<h2 id=\"关于本站\"><a href=\"#关于本站\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于本站\"></a>关于本站</h2><p>这是一个使用 <strong>Hexo</strong> 静态博客框架和 <strong>ZenMind</strong> 主题搭建的个人博客。</p>\n<p>在这里，我会分享技术思考、学习笔记、项目经验以及生活感悟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联系方式\"><a href=\"#联系方式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"联系方式\"></a>联系方式</h2><ul>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/your-username\">你的 GitHub</a></li>\n<li>Email: <a href=\"mailto:&#121;&#111;&#117;&#x72;&#45;&#101;&#109;&#x61;&#105;&#108;&#x40;&#101;&#120;&#97;&#x6d;&#x70;&#108;&#x65;&#x2e;&#x63;&#111;&#x6d;\">&#121;&#111;&#117;&#x72;&#45;&#101;&#109;&#x61;&#105;&#108;&#x40;&#101;&#120;&#97;&#x6d;&#x70;&#108;&#x65;&#x2e;&#x63;&#111;&#x6d;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关于-ZenMind-主题\"><a href=\"#关于-ZenMind-主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于 ZenMind 主题\"></a>关于 ZenMind 主题</h2><p>ZenMind 是一款简洁单栏 Hexo 主题，其名来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。由 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/lenchou95\">@lenchou95</a> 修改自 <a href=\"https://github.com/zheli-design/hexo-theme-one-paper\">one-paper</a> 主题。</p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"关于本站\"><a href=\"#关于本站\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于本站\"></a>关于本站</h2><p>这是一个使用 <strong>Hexo</strong> 静态博客框架和 <strong>ZenMind</strong> 主题搭建的个人博客。</p>\n<p>在这里，我会分享技术思考、学习笔记、项目经验以及生活感悟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联系方式\"><a href=\"#联系方式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"联系方式\"></a>联系方式</h2><ul>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/your-username\">你的 GitHub</a></li>\n<li>Email: <a href=\"mailto:&#121;&#111;&#117;&#x72;&#45;&#101;&#109;&#x61;&#105;&#108;&#x40;&#101;&#120;&#97;&#x6d;&#x70;&#108;&#x65;&#x2e;&#x63;&#111;&#x6d;\">&#121;&#111;&#117;&#x72;&#45;&#101;&#109;&#x61;&#105;&#108;&#x40;&#101;&#120;&#97;&#x6d;&#x70;&#108;&#x65;&#x2e;&#x63;&#111;&#x6d;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"关于-ZenMind-主题\"><a href=\"#关于-ZenMind-主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于 ZenMind 主题\"></a>关于 ZenMind 主题</h2><p>ZenMind 是一款简洁单栏 Hexo 主题，其名来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。由 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/lenchou95\">@lenchou95</a> 修改自 <a href=\"https://github.com/zheli-design/hexo-theme-one-paper\">one-paper</a> 主题。</p>\n"}],"Post":[{"title":"Hello ZenMind","date":"2026-06-02T06:30:47.000Z","_content":"\n欢迎来到我的静思博客！\n\n这是使用 **Hexo** 框架与 **ZenMind** 主题搭建的第一篇文章。\n\n## 关于 ZenMind 主题\n\nZenMind 是一款简洁的单栏 Hexo 主题，名称来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。它旨在为读者和作者提供一个简洁、宁静的阅读与写作环境。\n\n## 功能特性\n\n- 响应式设计，兼容手机端、Pad 端以及 PC 端\n- 支持所有现代浏览器\n- Markdown 常用格式支持\n- 代码高亮、行数显示支持\n- 中英文兼容，显示良好\n\n### 代码示例\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet(name) {\n  console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);\n}\ngreet('ZenMind');\n```\n\n> 静思致远，宁静之心。\n\n开始你的博客之旅吧！\n","source":"_posts/Hello-ZenMind.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Hello ZenMind\ndate: 2026-06-02 14:30:47\ntags:\n  - Hexo\n  - 博客\ncategories:\n  - 随笔\n---\n\n欢迎来到我的静思博客！\n\n这是使用 **Hexo** 框架与 **ZenMind** 主题搭建的第一篇文章。\n\n## 关于 ZenMind 主题\n\nZenMind 是一款简洁的单栏 Hexo 主题，名称来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。它旨在为读者和作者提供一个简洁、宁静的阅读与写作环境。\n\n## 功能特性\n\n- 响应式设计，兼容手机端、Pad 端以及 PC 端\n- 支持所有现代浏览器\n- Markdown 常用格式支持\n- 代码高亮、行数显示支持\n- 中英文兼容，显示良好\n\n### 代码示例\n\n```javascript\nfunction greet(name) {\n  console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);\n}\ngreet('ZenMind');\n```\n\n> 静思致远，宁静之心。\n\n开始你的博客之旅吧！\n","slug":"Hello-ZenMind","published":1,"updated":"2026-06-02T06:30:56.709Z","comments":1,"layout":"post","photos":[],"_id":"cmpw9e8090001p2rqdyrgehp3","content":"<p>欢迎来到我的静思博客！</p>\n<p>这是使用 <strong>Hexo</strong> 框架与 <strong>ZenMind</strong> 主题搭建的第一篇文章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于-ZenMind-主题\"><a href=\"#关于-ZenMind-主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于 ZenMind 主题\"></a>关于 ZenMind 主题</h2><p>ZenMind 是一款简洁的单栏 Hexo 主题，名称来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。它旨在为读者和作者提供一个简洁、宁静的阅读与写作环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"功能特性\"><a href=\"#功能特性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"功能特性\"></a>功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>响应式设计，兼容手机端、Pad 端以及 PC 端</li>\n<li>支持所有现代浏览器</li>\n<li>Markdown 常用格式支持</li>\n<li>代码高亮、行数显示支持</li>\n<li>中英文兼容，显示良好</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\"><a href=\"#代码示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码示例\"></a>代码示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight javascript\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">greet</span>(<span class=\"params\">name</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"string\">`Hello, <span class=\"subst\">$&#123;name&#125;</span>!`</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"title function_\">greet</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;ZenMind&#x27;</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>静思致远，宁静之心。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>开始你的博客之旅吧！</p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>欢迎来到我的静思博客！</p>\n<p>这是使用 <strong>Hexo</strong> 框架与 <strong>ZenMind</strong> 主题搭建的第一篇文章。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于-ZenMind-主题\"><a href=\"#关于-ZenMind-主题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于 ZenMind 主题\"></a>关于 ZenMind 主题</h2><p>ZenMind 是一款简洁的单栏 Hexo 主题，名称来源于中文「静思」，寓意深入思考与宁静的心境。它旨在为读者和作者提供一个简洁、宁静的阅读与写作环境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"功能特性\"><a href=\"#功能特性\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"功能特性\"></a>功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>响应式设计，兼容手机端、Pad 端以及 PC 端</li>\n<li>支持所有现代浏览器</li>\n<li>Markdown 常用格式支持</li>\n<li>代码高亮、行数显示支持</li>\n<li>中英文兼容，显示良好</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\"><a href=\"#代码示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"代码示例\"></a>代码示例</h3><figure class=\"highlight javascript\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">greet</span>(<span class=\"params\">name</span>) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">  <span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"string\">`Hello, <span class=\"subst\">$&#123;name&#125;</span>!`</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"title function_\">greet</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;ZenMind&#x27;</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>静思致远，宁静之心。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>开始你的博客之旅吧！</p>\n"},{"title":"Hello World","_content":"Welcome to [Hexo](https://hexo.io/)! This is your very first post. Check [documentation](https://hexo.io/docs/) for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in [troubleshooting](https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html) or you can ask me on [GitHub](https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a new post\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo new \"My New Post\"\n```\n\nMore info: [Writing](https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html)\n\n### Run server\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo server\n```\n\nMore info: [Server](https://hexo.io/docs/server.html)\n\n### Generate static files\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo generate\n```\n\nMore info: [Generating](https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html)\n\n### Deploy to remote sites\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo deploy\n```\n\nMore info: [Deployment](https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html)\n","source":"_posts/hello-world.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Hello World\n---\nWelcome to [Hexo](https://hexo.io/)! This is your very first post. Check [documentation](https://hexo.io/docs/) for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in [troubleshooting](https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html) or you can ask me on [GitHub](https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a new post\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo new \"My New Post\"\n```\n\nMore info: [Writing](https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html)\n\n### Run server\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo server\n```\n\nMore info: [Server](https://hexo.io/docs/server.html)\n\n### Generate static files\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo generate\n```\n\nMore info: [Generating](https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html)\n\n### Deploy to remote sites\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo deploy\n```\n\nMore info: [Deployment](https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html)\n","slug":"hello-world","published":1,"date":"2026-06-02T06:26:15.287Z","updated":"2026-06-02T06:26:15.287Z","comments":1,"layout":"post","photos":[],"_id":"cmpw9e80x0008p2rqh91vgllr","content":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Quick-Start\"><a href=\"#Quick-Start\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Quick Start\"></a>Quick Start</h2><h3 id=\"Create-a-new-post\"><a href=\"#Create-a-new-post\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Create a new post\"></a>Create a new post</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo new <span class=\"string\">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Run-server\"><a href=\"#Run-server\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Run server\"></a>Run server</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Generate-static-files\"><a href=\"#Generate-static-files\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Generate static files\"></a>Generate static files</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a href=\"#Deploy-to-remote-sites\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Deploy to remote sites\"></a>Deploy to remote sites</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\">Deployment</a></p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"Quick-Start\"><a href=\"#Quick-Start\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Quick Start\"></a>Quick Start</h2><h3 id=\"Create-a-new-post\"><a href=\"#Create-a-new-post\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Create a new post\"></a>Create a new post</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo new <span class=\"string\">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Run-server\"><a href=\"#Run-server\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Run server\"></a>Run server</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Generate-static-files\"><a href=\"#Generate-static-files\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Generate static files\"></a>Generate static files</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"Deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a href=\"#Deploy-to-remote-sites\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Deploy to remote sites\"></a>Deploy to remote sites</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\">Deployment</a></p>\n"}],"PostAsset":[],"PostCategory":[{"post_id":"cmpw9e8090001p2rqdyrgehp3","category_id":"cmpw9e80r0002p2rq0lraa8sz","_id":"cmpw9e80v0005p2rq7iqx5wph"}],"PostTag":[{"post_id":"cmpw9e8090001p2rqdyrgehp3","tag_id":"cmpw9e80r0003p2rqdx1k8hyz","_id":"cmpw9e80v0006p2rq9ixi0on0"},{"post_id":"cmpw9e8090001p2rqdyrgehp3","tag_id":"cmpw9e80u0004p2rq031f3otd","_id":"cmpw9e80v0007p2rqdtzt8duo"}],"Tag":[{"name":"Hexo","_id":"cmpw9e80r0003p2rqdx1k8hyz"},{"name":"博客","_id":"cmpw9e80u0004p2rq031f3otd"}]}}